				PRINTFORML 「While I very much enjoy our time together, my love...」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou lays a hand on yours, face solemn.
				PRINTFORML 「I am afraid that I must ask you to restrain yourself from any blatant displays of affection while we are away from our homes.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sighing, she rubs a thumb across your palm.
				PRINTFORML 「It would not do for word of our relationship to spread across Gensokyo.」
				PRINTFORMDW Her eyes grow dark.
				PRINTFORMW 「Too many of the rivals of our temple would use it against us.」
				CALLF FIRSTTIME("ShouLoverDate")

			CASE 27
				SIF !DAY:2 == 4
					GOTO SHOU_CONVERSATIONS
				PRINTFORML 「I've been working on something for my subordinate.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou rustles her hand in one of her sleeves.
				PRINTFORML 「She's always using her dowsing rods, even during these cold months, so I thought-」
				PRINTFORMDL With a note of triumph, she pulls out a pair of grey... things.
				PRINTFORMW 「-that I should make her a pair of these ingenious little articles that Sumireko calls 'mittens"".」
				PRINTFORMDL Shou presents the misshapen pieces of cloth rather proudly.
				PRINTFORMDL ...
				PRINTFORMDW To be frank, even though you know what they're supposed to be, you can't see anything but a mess of cloth.
				PRINTFORMW 「What do you think?」
				PRINTFORMDW Looking at Shou's earnest expression, you tell her that Nazrin will most likely appreciate the thought.

			CASE 28
				SIF !IS_FALLEN([[星]])
					GOTO SHOU_CONVERSATIONS
				PRINTFORML 「Nazrin is my closest companion, and I am eternally grateful to her for her loyalty.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou leans backwards, sighing.
				PRINTFORMW 「She has seen fit to forgive me for the many missteps I have made over the years, so I cannot help but repay her in kind.」
				IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
					PRINTFORMDL Her face grows distant.
					PRINTFORML 「There was a time, just after Hijiri was sealed, that I forgot my duties.」
					PRINTFORMW 「No, I didn't forget my duties, rather, I felt that there was no point to them, with Hijiri gone.」
					PRINTFORMDL Shou pierces your eyes with a dark stare.
					PRINTFORMW 「She was my world, in those days, and with my world gone, I was lost.」
					PRINTFORMDL She breaks off your impromptu staring contest first, casting her eyes down.
					PRINTFORMW 「Nazrin saved me then. She forced me to be more than just a statue made of flesh, made me eat and drink, brought me trinkets she had found...」
					PRINTFORML 「I do not rightly know why she did so. By all rights, she should have taken the Jeweled Pagoda and returned to Bishamonten's side.」
					PRINTFORMDW Shou pauses, fingers slowly drumming along the shaft of her spear.
					PRINTFORMW 「But she saw fit to save me at my lowest, and how can I hope to repay her for her benevolence?」
				ENDIF

			CASE 29
				SIF CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_SHOU_RAW_SEX != 6
					GOTO SHOU_CONVERSATIONS
				PRINTFORML 「...I still find it hard to believe that Bishamonten-dono...」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou blushes.
				PRINTFORML 「Expected me to be with child when I contacted him.」
				PRINTFORMDW She shifts, leaning into your shoulder.
				PRINTFORMW 「I would like to think that my self-control is such that that would not occur.」

			CASE 30
				SIF CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_DAYS_AFTER < 4
					GOTO SHOU_CONVERSATIONS
				PRINTFORML 「My love?」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou is looking directly into your eyes.
				PRINTFORMW 「As I understand it, you are to blame for Bishamonten-dono deciding to visit my dreams each night.」
				PRINTFORMDL ...
				PRINTFORMDL Not intentionally.
				PRINTFORMDW Shou releases a noise not unlike a cat being stepped on.
				PRINTFORML 「So I have you to thank for my troubled nights.」
				PRINTFORMDL The glare Shou fixes you with is exceptionally cross.
				PRINTFORMW 「I have not had a good night's rest since your conversation with him!」
				PRINTFORMDL Cringing, you raise your hands in apology.
				PRINTFORMDW You didn't intend for Bishamonten to start disturbing Shou daily. You just pointed out that he's not really talked to Shou, well, ever.
				PRINTFORMDL Shou sighs at your words, frowning.
				PRINTFORMW 「...I cannot deny your words, my love.」
				PRINTFORMDL Shou pouts at you.
				PRINTFORMW 「But there surely should have been some way to remedy that other than Bishamonten-dono pulling me from my dreams each night.」
				PRINTFORMDL You can't help but object that you didn't suggest that to him.
				PRINTFORMDW Shou sighs at your words, shaking her head with a smile.
				PRINTFORML 「...Only you, my love.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou lays a hand over yours.
				PRINTFORMW 「...Thank you.」
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

