				PRINTFORMDW Despite a few surprised struggles, Shou quickly relaxes into the kiss, arms hanging loosely by her side.
				CALL MUTUAL_KISS([[星]])
				PRINTFORMDW When you break the kiss, her eyes are lidded, contentment warring with forced distaste on her face.
				PRINTFORML 「...Do not think that this will-」
				PRINTFORMDW Gently, you lay a finger on her lips, allowing you to say your piece.
				PRINTFORMDL 
