				PRINTFORMDW Rather, you let her down as gently as possible in a bid to spare both her and Nazrin as much heartbreak as possible.
				PRINTFORMDW Now that Nazrin has given you her approval to pursue a relationship with the lovely woman in front of you, you would be delighted to court her.
