				PRINTFORMDW Awkwardly, you pat her on the back as she cries into your shoulder, body shaking.
				PRINTFORMDL 
				PRINTFORMDW After several minutes, Shou's tears have dried.
				PRINTFORMDW She's still in your arms, slack with emotional exhaustion.
				PRINTFORMW 「...My apologies, %MASTERNAME:87%. I am afraid that the past several days have weighed heavily on my mind.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou's words are carefully even as she peels herself off of you.
				PRINTFORMDW She carefully takes a deep breath.
				PRINTFORMW 「If you truly wish to court me...」
				PRINTFORMDW She hesitates, eyes screwing shut.
				PRINTFORMW 「And Nazrin has given you her blessing to do so...」
				PRINTFORMDW Even as her body trembles, Shou's voice remains steady.
				PRINTFORMW 「..Then I-」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou's voice cracks.
				PRINTFORMW 「-I would very much wish for you to court me.」
				PRINTFORMDW Gently, you cup Shou's cheek as she breaks down, silent tears on her cheeks.
				PRINTFORMDW As your lips meet again, your new lover wraps her arms around you.
				CALL MUTUAL_KISS([[星]])
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW Shou's expression darkens, an ominous creaking sound emanating from her spear.
				PRINTFORMW 「You are a philanderer and a scoundrel, to ask that of me when you are already courting my servant!」
