			ENDIF
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDW Shou tilts her head down for a moment, face clouded.
			IF CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_REJECTED_CONFESSION
				PRINTFORMDW When she looks up again, the anger in her eyes nearly makes you stumble back.
