				PRINTFORMDW Hurriedly, you shake your head no, but Shou continues.
				PRINTFORMW 「Do you think I am but some puppet you can command to dance for your amusement?」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou's voice is tightly controlled, level, and even as she questions you, every word as sharp as a blade.
				PRINTFORMW 「Do you care only for your own wants, and ignore those devastated by your actions?」
				PRINTFORMDW There's an awful glint in Shou's eyes as her voice deepens.
				PRINTFORMW 「Well, %MASTERNAME:87%? What do you say for yourself?」
				PRINTFORMDW Slowly, you try your best to breathe deeply and calm your racing heart as Shou continues to glare at you.
				PRINTFORMDW Hesitantly, the barest stitches of a plan come together in your mind.
				PRINTFORMDW You'll have to grovel more than you'd prefer, but that's the price you pay for trying to confess to someone you rejected.
				PRINTFORMW 「Well?」
