				PRINTFORMDW Surprised, you trail off into silence, glancing up at Shou for the first time since you began your confession.
				PRINTFORMDW Shou appears for all the world to be a statue, eyes downcast as she absorbs your words.
				PRINTFORMW 「...Do you truly mean all that you have said?」
				PRINTFORMDW Her voice is rough, almost like she can't figure out what she's saying as the words leave her mouth.
				PRINTFORMDW Hesitantly, you voice your affirmation, drawing closer to Shou as you do so.
				PRINTFORMW 「...Promise me.」
				PRINTFORMDW The words spill out of Shou's mouth raw and broken.
				PRINTFORMW 「Promise me that you will not play with my heart again.」
				PRINTFORMDW Looking into her pained eyes, you swear to love her honestly, now and forever.
				PRINTFORMW 「...Thank you.」
