				CALL MUTUAL_KISS([[星]])
				PRINTFORMDL 
				PRINTFORMDW You don't know how long the two of you stand there. only that by the time you come up for air the shadows around you have moved.
				PRINTFORMDW You meet your new lover's gaze, and blush despite yourself.
				PRINTFORMDW the way she blushes is adorable, though.
				PRINTFORMDW Laughing, you pull her in for another kiss.
				PRINTFORMDW There's nowhere the two of you need to be, so no one interrupts you as you explore your newfound relationship with your lover.
				CALL MUTUAL_KISS([[星]])
				PRINTFORMDW When the time comes to part, it's with easy smiles, and you promise to find Shou later with a smile on your face and love in your heart.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Forgive me for my impertinence, %MASTERNAME:87%, but I must ask, why me?」
				PRINTFORML %BREAKENG("「There are many others, even in this temple, who would be able to give you far more time than my duties as an Avatar of Bishamonten-dono would allow. Ichirin or Mamizou might even-」")%
