				PRINTFORMDW They would not be the the earnest, kind woman who stands in front of you now.
				PRINTFORMDW They would not be the woman who welcomes your presence with a smile, no matter the day or time.
				PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("And, at the risk of sounding conceited, less time spent together with the woman you love would make the small moments where you are both free to cherish each other all the sweeter.")%
				PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("But most of all, you have not fallen in love with anyone except for the woman standing in front of you, and that is why you are not pursuing a relationship with anyone else.")%
				PRINTFORMW 「....Ah.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou stands in front of you, struck speechless by your heartfelt confession.
				PRINTFORMDW The only sign that she has not become a statue is the steady flushing of her face.
				PRINTFORMW 「I... Well, I....」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou stumbles over her words, trying and failing to find some adequate response.
				PRINTFORMW 「I suppose that, if you are amenable, and willing, of course, that I am interested in...」
				PRINTFORMDW Her words come out slowly, each one considered before it is spoken, as her face flames from the tip of her chin to the roots of her hair.
				PRINTFORMW 「Our relationship is, well, I would enjoy seeing what could come of it..」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou hunches in on herself, looking for all the world like a nervous teenager.
				PRINTFORMW 「If you wish to, I would not mind you courting me.」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
