@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COM_K87_405_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	;TARGETとデート
	IF CFLAG:同行
		SELECTCASE IFRAND("0", !(TALENT:[[星]]:恋慕 || TALENT:[[星]]:恋人), "1", IS_FALLEN([[星]]) && !TALENT:[[星]]:恋人, "2", TALENT:[[星]]:恋慕 && !TALENT:[[星]]:恋人, "3", TALENT:[[星]]:恋人)
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORML 「You wish to show me something outside Myouren Temple?」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou puts a hand to her chin, contemplating your request.
				PRINTFORMW 「I am happy to accompany you to your destination, %MASTERNAME:87%.」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORML 「Ah, you have more to show me?」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou smiles brightly.
				PRINTFORMW 「I do look forward to seeing what you have to show me today, %MASTERNAME:87%.」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORML 「To leave together for the day...」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou fixes you with a sharp look.
				PRINTFORML 「There are those who might spread unsavory rumors about such an event.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sighing, Shou adjusts her grip on her spear.
				PRINTFORML 「But they will spread rumors regardless, and I do look forward to our excursions, %MASTERNAME:87%.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Let us leave.」
			CASE 3
				PRINTFORML 「I am more than happy to spend time with you, my love.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou smiles at you, eyes bright.
				PRINTFORML 「No matter where we spend time.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou's face takes on a dusting of pink.
				PRINTFORML 「In any case, away from the temple, there are things we can do that I dare not contemplate performing on such sacred grounds.」
				PRINTFORMDW Examining your blushing lover, you can imagine that if \@ CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_SHOU_SECRET == 2 ? her ears were visible, they'd be folded # she had a tail, it'd be flicking from side to side\@.
				PRINTFORML 「Let us go, quickly.」
				PRINTFORMDW Smiling, you let your lover draw you onwards.
		ENDSELECT
	;TARGET以外とデート
	ELSEIF CFLAG:MASTER:同行
	;お出かけお見送り
	ELSE
	ENDIF

	;I couldn't find a KOJO call for refusing to go on a date so I'm just putting it here
	; SIF !IS_FALLEN([[星]])
	; 	PRINTFORMW 「My apologies, %MASTERNAME:87%, but I currently have no desire to leave the temple grounds.」
ENDIF
RETURN 1
