@M_KOJO_EGG_MESSAGE_COM_K87_411_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > ABL:[[星]]:戦闘能力
		PRINTFORMDW Lasers. Lasers everywhere.
		PRINTFORML 「Very good, \@ TALENT:[[星]]:恋人 ? my love # %MASTERNAME:87% \@! Keep it up!」
		PRINTFORMDW Shou's words of encouragement are somewhat undercut by her pagoda flashing again, heralding a new wave of lasers.
		PRINTFORML 「Now let's see you get past this!」
		PRINTFORMDW The lasers are starting to split.
		PRINTFORMDW ...
		PRINTFORMDW Lovely.
		PRINTFORMW 「"Complete Clarification"!」
		PRINTFORMDL You can't see Shou through the light given off by the lasers.
		PRINTFORMDW But if you take a risk...
		PRINTFORMDL 
		PRINTFORMDW There!
		PRINTFORMDW Dashing through a momentary gap in Shou's net of lasers, you rush towards her, trying to close into melee.
		PRINTFORMDL She's raising her spear to ward you off, but if you just duck――
		PRINTFORMW 「Ack!」
		PRINTFORMDL ――and twist to your right, you can land a solid burst on her from point blank.
		PRINTFORMW 「Hold!」
		PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("You come to a rest at Shou's demand, hand poised for another shot of Danmaku as she catches her breath, rubbing the spot where your bullets impacted her.")%
		PRINTFORMDL 
		PRINTFORMDL Slowly, she stands up straight, looking you in the eye.
		PRINTFORMW 「That was far more daring an assault than I expected.」
		IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
			PRINTFORMDW ...Oh, those are some nice eyes.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDW ...That's a fierce look she's got there.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORML 「Allow me to match your audacity with my own!」
		PRINTFORMDW Hurriedly, you step to the side as Shou lunges at you, the butt of her spear passing through the space your right shoulder occupied moments ago.
		PRINTFORML 「Goo-!?」
		PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("Before she can praise your reflexes or pull her spear back, you make a grab for the haft of her spear, quickly ripping it out of her grip with a flick of your wrist.")%
		PRINTFORMDW Missing her melee weapon, Shou jumps backwards to gain some distance, opening herself up to another blast of Danmaku.
		PRINTFORMDW ...
		PRINTFORMDW Back and forth the two of you fight, vying to either close the distance between each other or extend it.
		PRINTFORMW 「Excellent! Learn your strengths, and exploit them!」
		PRINTFORMDL Throughout it all, Shou is constantly shouting words of encouragement...
		PRINTFORMW 「Oof!」
		PRINTFORMDW Until one of your wild lunges gets you too close to Shou, and you end up on top of her as you both lie in the dirt, groaning.
		IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
			PRINTFORMW 「...Hello, my love.」
			PRINTFORMDW ...
			PRINTFORMDW As Shou takes the opportunity to kiss you, you return the favor in kind.
			CALL MUTUAL_KISS([[星]])
			PRINTFORMDL 
			PRINTFORMDW Neither of you get up for quite a while.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「...Would you please kindly move?」
			PRINTFORMDW ...
			PRINTFORMDW Shou rolls you off of her when you're a bit slow to stand up.
			PRINTFORMDW By the time you're standing as well, she's already leaving.
			CFLAG:[[星]]:現在位置 = KICKOUT()
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 == ABL:[[星]]:戦闘能力
		PRINTFORML 「You wish to train in the art of Danmaku?」
		PRINTFORMDW Shou sighs, before raising her pagoda.
		PRINTFORML 「Please take care to warn me if you are getting overwhelmed.」
		PRINTFORMDW You ready yourself for the barrage of homing lasers.
		PRINTFORMDW ...
		PRINTFORMDL As the training progresses, it's clear you've somehow managed to become accustomed to Shou's neverending barrage of homing lasers.
		PRINTFORMDW In fact, you're able to counter her waves of danmaku quite effectively, even scoring a few hits of your own as well.
		PRINTFORMDW After a particularly skillful exchange, she steps back, clearly impressed.
		PRINTFORML 「You are quite full of surprises, \@ TALENT:[[星]]:恋人 ? my love # %MASTERNAME:87%\@!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Those who can match the full might of my pagoda are few and far between.」
		PRINTFORMDL Shou's eyes are gleaming with happiness and something a bit sharper.
		PRINTFORMDW ...She's raising her pagoda again.
		PRINTFORML 「Another round?」
		PRINTFORMDW Well, if that's what the lady wishes for, who are you to deny her?
	ELSE
		SELECTCASE RAND:2
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORML 「You wish to train in the art of Danmaku, %MASTERNAME:87%?」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou looks at you with no small amount of hesitation.
				PRINTFORMW 「...Very well. I will endeavour to provide a learning experience for you.」
				PRINTFORMDW You smile and take a few steps back, arms raised in a passable imitation of a boxer's stance.
				PRINTFORMDL Shou raises her pagoda to about chest height, arm fully outstretched.
				PRINTFORMDW Wait, why's it shining?
				PRINTFORMDL ...Oh shi-!
				PRINTFORMDW ＼　Pichuuuun　／
				PRINTFORMW 「%MASTERNAME:87%!」
				PRINTFORMDL You're flat on your back. At least, you think you are.
				PRINTFORMDW The relentless barrage of lasers has left you uncertain of which direction, precisely, is up.
				PRINTFORML 「My most sincere apologies \@ TALENT:[[星]]:恋人 ? , my love # for this\@.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou is kneeling over you, worry etched deep into her features.
				PRINTFORMDW You let her know you're fine, you just need a second for the room to stop spinning.
				PRINTFORML 「...Okay. I will endeavour to hold back further in any future attempts at training, \@ TALENT:[[星]]:恋人 ? my love # %MASTERNAME:87%\@.」
				PRINTFORMDW ...That would be for the best.

			CASE 1
				PRINTFORML 「You wish to train for combat?」
				PRINTFORML 「With me as your instructor?」
				PRINTFORMW 「If you wish to learn to throw a punch, or shoot Danmaku, there are others who are far better suited to teach you.」
				PRINTFORMDW Shou raises her pagoda, her solemn gaze just barely undercut by a hint of excitement.
				PRINTFORMDL 
				PRINTFORMDW ...You get ready to move.
				PRINTFORML 「All that I can teach you...」
				PRINTFORMDW ...That light can't be good.
				PRINTFORMW 「...is how to DODGE!!」
				PRINTFORMDW ...Fucking lasers.
				PRINTFORMDL 
				PRINTFORMDW ...
				PRINTFORMDL 
				PRINTFORMDW ...Stupid fucking homing lasers.
				PRINTFORMDL 
				IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
					PRINTFORMW 「Apologies, my love. I thought that I was holding back more of my power.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「Um... are you all right?」
				ENDIF
				PRINTFORMDL You're somehow still on your feet, trying to steady yourself on your knees as you attempt to catch your breath.
				PRINTFORMDW Small bruises and first-degree burns are speckled across your exposed skin, testament to the times Shou's lasers found their mark.
				IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
					PRINTFORMDL Your lover casts a critical eye over your battered body, wincing whenever she spots another contusion.
					PRINTFORML 「...You should go to Hijiri-sama for aid in healing your wounds.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「Do you need someone to help you heal?」
				ENDIF
				PRINTFORMDW With a great, heaving breath, you stagger upright and tell her that you'll be fine after some rest.
				IF TALENT:[[星]]:恋人
					PRINTFORML 「No. I will not let you suffer for my mistake. We will visit Hijiri-sama, and you will accept her aid.」
					PRINTFORMDW Shou picks you up by the scruff of your neck and drags you to the leader of Myouren Temple, despite your protests.
					PRINTFORMW 「While you may think it is \@ IS_MALE(MASTER) ? the peak of masculinity # laudable\@ to suffer wounds without complaint, I will not see the one I love permanently harmed by my actions!」
					PRINTFORMDL 
					PRINTFORMDW It seems that you underestimated your lover's protectiveness.
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「...Very well.」
					PRINTFORMDW Though she clearly doesn't believe you, Shou lets the matter drop.
					PRINTFORMW 「I hope your rest is pleasant, and your recovery is swift.」
				ENDIF
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
