			PRINTFORMW 「I will see what I can do to fulfill your request, Shou Toramaru.」
			PRINTFORMDW Bishamonten's voice starts to slowly recede as his presence recedes.
			PRINTFORMW 「Do tell me when you know you are pregnant.」
			PRINTFORMDW With that remark, he is gone.
			PRINTFORMDW Shou very shakily stands up and wobbles over to you.
			PRINTFORMDW You catch her as she collapses into your arms.
			PRINTFORMW 「...Thank you, my love.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou's arms curl around me.
			PRINTFORMW 「...I was not expecting to hear any response.」
			PRINTFORMDW Gently you pat your lover's shoulder.
			PRINTFORMDW It's good, at least, that Bishamonten supports your plans for children.
			PRINTFORMDW The laugh that comes out of Shou's mouth has more than a faint tinge of hysteria to it.
			PRINTFORMW 「...That is true.」
			PRINTFORMDW It takes several long minutes before Shou breaks the embrace with a regretful smile.
			CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_SHOU_FIRST_TIME_PRAYER = 1
		ELSEIF CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_SHOU_FIRST_TIME_PRAYER == 1
			PRINTFORMW 「My love, I am not certain that this is a wise course of action.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou voices her disapproval as you step towards the honzon, a stick of incense carried in one hand, and a fire striker in the other.
			PRINTFORMW 「Bishamonten-dono has been lenient so far, but his patience cannot last forever. Please, do not test him.」
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("While Shou's anxiety is plain on her face, she makes no move to stop you as you prepare the incense and kneel in front of the image of Bishamonten, hands clasped in prayer.")%
			PRINTFORMDW You pray for a child for yourself and Shou to come soon, and in good health.
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("And privately, you also pray that if Bishamonten does decide to respond to your prayers, he doesn't include Shou, because she might actually have a heart attack if he talks to her again.")%
			PRINTFORMW 「...」
			PRINTFORMDW ...
			PRINTFORMW 「I must admit, it is rare that one adds such a specific stipulation to their prayers, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
			PRINTFORMDW Trying to fight a smile, you say hello to Bishamonten, and wish him well.
			PRINTFORMW 「Thank you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. I hope that you are doing well on this day as well.」
			PRINTFORMDW You get the distinct impression of someone shuffling through some papers.
			PRINTFORMW 「I will not apologize for the two of you not having a child yet.」
			PRINTFORMW %BREAKENG("「I may be able to nudge the odds of conception in your favor, but fertility blessings are not my area of expertise, and conception is never a sure thing.」")%
			PRINTFORMDW You barely restrain yourself from nodding physically, instead doing your best to mentally nod in agreement.
			PRINTFORMDW You hardly expected anything else.
			PRINTFORMDW Though, since Bishamonten confirmed that he gave his blessing, you can rest easy and not bother him again for now.
			PRINTFORMW 「A moment, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
			PRINTFORMDW Bishamonten's presence looms over you.
			PRINTFORMW 「Why did you ask that I not include your lover in this conversation?」
			PRINTFORMDW Biting back your instinctive response of scrambling backwards from the annoyed deity, you try to formulate a response.
			PRINTFORMDL "Because she's terrified of you" doesn't seem quite right, but-
			PRINTFORMW 「-Why would Shou be terrified of me? She is my Avatar, and has been for over a millennium.」
			PRINTFORMDW Fuck.
			PRINTFORMDW Carefully, you try to organize your thoughts into what you know about Shou's feelings towards her ultimate boss.
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("From your impression, which, admittedly, is incomplete, Shou is keenly aware of how much of her current life can be stripped away if she loses her status as an Avatar of Bishamonten, and tries her absolute best to avoid doing anything that she doesn't think that Bishamonten would approve of.")%
			PRINTFORMW 「...I am many things, but I am not a cruel deity. I would not cast out Shou for making a mistake.」
			PRINTFORMDW That's very well and good, but Shou doesn't really know that. She's only spoken to Bishamonten directly three times.
			PRINTFORMW 「...」
			PRINTFORMDW Bishamonten's presence retreats for a split second.
			PRINTFORMW 「...You are right, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
			PRINTFORMW 「It is easy to fear that which is unknown, and I have not made the effort to let Shou know me as much as I should have.」
			PRINTFORMDW The image of Bishamonten appears to sigh.
			PRINTFORMW 「I do not normally make an effort to connect with my human Avatars, as they die almost as soon as I appoint them, from my perspective.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I thought I could do the same with Shou, but evidently, I was mistaken.」
			PRINTFORMDW You distantly hear a wet brush dragging over paper.
			PRINTFORMW 「I will take steps to correct this, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. And, I see now why Shou fell in love with you so deeply.」
			PRINTFORMDW A ghost of a laugh echoes around the room.
			PRINTFORMW 「You are one of the bravest people I have ever known.」
			PRINTFORMDW As Bishamonten's presence fades, you let out a shaky breath, trying to will some feeling back into your trembling hands.
			PRINTFORMDW Shou is at your side in an instant, eyes darting over every inch of your body as her hands grasp your shoulders.
			PRINTFORMW 「My love, please, I-」
			PRINTFORMDW There are tears in her eyes.
			PRINTFORMW 「Please don't do this again.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shakily, you nod, before wrapping your arms around her.
			PRINTFORMDW She melts into your embrace, letting her sobs come freely.
			PRINTFORMDW As you gently rock her in your arms, you whisper an apology into her ear.
			PRINTFORMW 「My love?」
			PRINTFORMDW You tell her not to worry about it.
			CFLAG:[[星]]:K87EGG_SHOU_FIRST_TIME_PRAYER = 2
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 / 100 != 1
		PRINTFORML 「I must say, it feels somewhat strange to be standing here.」
		PRINTFORMDW Shou's fingers curl and uncurl around her spear, nervously flexing as she casts her gaze around the shrine.
		PRINTFORML 「To seek out the aid of a god other than the one I am sworn to...」
		PRINTFORMDW Shou frowns, brow creased in thought.
		PRINTFORML 「...But to bother Bishamonten-dono with matters such as this would be more disrespectful, I feel.」
		PRINTFORMDW Nodding, she turns to look at you.
		PRINTFORMW 「Now then, shall we?」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

