			PRINTFORMW 「Well then, I will leave you to your duties, good sir.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou turns away from the injured tengu and swiftly walks away, spear thudding into the dirt of the path.
			PRINTFORMDW Muffling a curse, you hustle after your companion, jogging to catch up.
			PRINTFORMDW After you draw level with Shou, you slowly try to catch your breath while powerwalking as fast as you can.
			PRINTFORMW 「My apologies, %MASTERNAME:87%, but we must make all due haste.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou swiftly strides forward, a certain urgency in her steps.
			PRINTFORMW 「The sooner we reach our destination, the sooner we will be able to find help for that poor man.」
			PRINTFORMDW Through strained breaths, you try to convey your disbelief that the tengu you left behind would accept any help from anyone.
			PRINTFORMDW Or be in the same place whenever someone who would help him got there.
			PRINTFORMW 「That may be so.」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou nods her head as she walks, acknowledging our point.
			PRINTFORMW 「But that is no excuse not to try.」
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORMDW Shou stumbles to a stop, eyes wide.
			PRINTFORMW 「!!!」
			PRINTFORMDW As you turn to your companion, you see her sniffing at the air, eyes closed in concentration.
			PRINTFORMW 「Oh no.」
			PRINTFORMDW Before you can stop her, Shou has taken off at a dead sprint, robes fluttering behind her as she dashes off the road, slipping between trees.
			PRINTFORMDW Cursing, you start after her, pushing your way through the underbrush.
			PRINTFORMDW In the distance, but far closer than you'd like, something snarls.
			PRINTFORMDW With another curse, you pick up your pace, hoping you'll be able to catch up to Shou before something happens to her.
			PRINTFORMW 「Foul creature!」
			PRINTFORMDW The voice of your current source of consternation rings out through the trees, prompting a third round of cursing as you hurry forward.
			PRINTFORMDW At last, the brush parts into a clearing.
			PRINTFORMDW And the scene within you stumble into is right out of a storybook.
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("On the left side of the clearing, huddled under a tree, is a young couple, clearly not yet out of their teens, the girl clutching the boy, who is clearly injured, burns running over his right shoulder and arm.")%
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("Above them, the branches of the tree, some sort of animate fire dances and weaves between the leaves, blackening but never igniting anything as it crackles in frustration.")%
			PRINTFORMDW Between the distressed couple and the monster stands your companion, back straight, eyes narrowed, spear extended and pagoda aloft.
			PRINTFORMW 「These people are not your prey!」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou lifts her pagoda higher as a blinding white light emanates from its depths.
			PRINTFORMW 「I banish you, who would prey on those less fortunate! Now, disappear!」
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("Even as you close your eyes, the light emanating from Shou's pagoda flares to such a high intensity that you can see shadows of the clearing through your eyelids.")%
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("When you finally manage to blink the stars out of your eyes, Shou is kneeling over the young couple, engaged in a quiet conversation with the young woman, and there is no sign of the youkai that attacked them.")%
			PRINTFORMW 「-we'll be fine, Bishamonten-dono. Tamame here just got a bit careless.」
			PRINTFORMDW The young woman rubs the uninjured shoulder of her boyfriend, who winces.
