			PRINTFORMDW The woman bows as much as one can when sitting with another person in their lap.
			PRINTFORMW 「Now, allow me to escort you to the village, and to a physician.」
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("Shou gently slips an arm around the waist of the boy, and lifts him up, supporting his weight as they start to walk in your direction, the girl hovering nervously at her boyfriend's side.")%
			PRINTFORMW 「...Ah, %MASTERNAME:87%. My apologies for rushing off.」
			PRINTFORMDW Smiling, you raise a hand to let her know all is forgiven.
