			PRINTFORMW 「This is going to be painful, little one, so you're going to have to be brave.」
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("By the time you turn around, the boy has started sobbing again while Shou stares at him helplessly, two strips of cloth torn from the hem of her robe in her grasp.")%
			PRINTFORMDW She looks at you, then at the branch in your hand, then at the boy's arm.
			PRINTFORMW 「Quickly now. On the count of three.」
			PRINTFORMDW You grab the boy's shoulder and upper arm, while Shou gently grabs the boy's hand and forearm.
			PRINTFORMW 「Be brave. One, tw-」
			PRINTFORMDW With a swift, gentle yank, Shou straightens the boy's arm with an audible crack.
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("The howl of pain that forces its way out of the boy's throat is nearly inhuman, but, to his credit, he doesn't try to yank his broken arm away from you, nor does he move while Shou quickly binds the splint onto his arm.")%
			PRINTFORMDW Within half a minute, the boy is blinking back tears as he examines the splint.
