			PRINTFORMW 「Very well. Do you wish for me to carry you?」
			PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG("At the boy's nod, Shou gently worms one arm under the boy's torso while the other snakes its way under his legs before she lifts him up, the small boy positively tiny compared to her tall frame.")%
			PRINTFORMW 「Now, where does your mother live?」
			PRINTFORMDW Shou sets down the road, following the boy's pointed finger. After a moment to grab her spear and pagoda, you follow.
			PRINTFORMDW You walk in silence for several minutes, the boy too exhausted to do anything and neither of you wanting to disturb him.
			PRINTFORMW 「Kenji! KENJI!」
